            "reusable_item": 2,
            "role": "explanation",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "below",
              "reference": {
                "source": "local_board_item",
                "moment": 2,
                "item": 1
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "version": "0.1",
    "section": 2,
    "moments": [
      {
        "narration": "现在我把截面位置 y₀ 从 0 平移到 1。请注意，平移截面只是在选择我们要研究哪一条截线，平移本身并不是对 x 求导。",
        "delivery": "patient",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "animate",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "number": 1,
            "end_value": 1,
            "duration_intent": "normal",
            "easing": "linear"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "当固定 y 等于 1 时，代入原曲面得到一元截线方程 g(x) 等于 x 平方加 1。若取 x₀ 等于 1，则对应空间点 P 为 (1, 1, 2)。",
        "delivery": "emphatic",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "math",
            "timing": "after_speech",
            "content": {
              "latex": "y_0=1 \\implies z=g(x)=x^2+1, \\quad P=(1,1,2)"
            },
            "role": "derivation",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "below",
              "reference": {
                "source": "reusable",
                "section": 1,
                "item": 3
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "math",
            "timing": "after_speech",
            "content": {
              "latex": "g'(1)=\\left.\\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}\\right|_{(1,1)}=2"
            },
            "reusable_item": 1,
            "role": "derivation",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "below",
              "reference": {
                "source": "local_board_item",
                "moment": 2,
                "item": 1
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "我们建立二维平面函数图，其中横轴表示 x，纵轴表示高度 z。图中标注了截线与在点 P 处斜率为 2 的切线，可以看到切线与抛物线精准相切。",
        "delivery": "patient",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "visual",
            "timing": "before_speech",
            "content": {
