  {
    "version": "0.1",
    "section": 3,
    "moments": [
      {
        "narration": "我们在二维截面图中对截线函数 $g(x) = x^2 + 1$ 求导，得到一元导函数 $g'(x) = 2x$。在 $x=1$ 处，导数值 $g'(1) = 2$。",
        "delivery": "patient",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "math",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "content": {
              "latex": "g'(x) = 2x \\implies g'(1) = 2"
            },
            "reusable_item": 1,
            "role": "derivation",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "below",
              "reference": {
                "source": "reusable",
                "section": 2,
                "item": 2
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "action": "focus",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "intent": "关注截线函数在x=1处的求导结果",
            "references": [
              {
                "source": "reusable",
                "section": 2,
                "item": 2
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "已知切点为 $(1, 2)$，根据点斜式 $z - 2 = 2(x - 1)$，整理得到切线方程 $z = 2x$。这里的斜率 2 代表高度增量与 $x$ 增量的极限比值，而不是屏幕上用量角器量出的角度。",
        "delivery": "emphatic",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "note",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "content": {
              "title": "截线切线与偏导数",
              "items": [
                "切点: (1, 2)",
                "点斜式: z - 2 = 2(x - 1) => z = 2x",
                "斜率本质: 高度变化率 Δz/Δx，非视觉角度",
                "一般偏导公式: f_x(x₀, y₀) = 2x₀"
              ]
            },
            "reusable_item": 2,
            "role": "explanation",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "below",
              "reference": {
                "source": "local_board_item",
                "moment": 1,
                "item": 1
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "action": "point_at",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "reference": {
              "source": "reusable",
              "section": 2,
              "item": 2
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "抽象到一般情形，对 $f(x,y) = x^2 + y^2$ 求偏导数，得到 $f_x(x_0, y_0) = 2x_0$。这里斜率只与 $x_0$ 有关，是该函数二次齐次特性的结果，并不意味着所有曲面都与 $y_0$ 无关。例如当 $f(x,y) = xy$ 时，偏导数 $f_x = y$ 就与 $y$ 强相关。",
        "delivery": "careful",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "focus",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "intent": "明确偏导数的几何意义与结论适用边界",
            "references": [
              {
                "source": "reusable",
                "section": 2,
                "item": 2
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
